iles/1/0735/4833/3323/files/hf_20260501_064955_ad275b98-8abb-4c11-a188-861084ff14a3.png"},{"type":"html","id":"ggy6p9epCVU_text","label":"ggy6p9epCVU_text","default":"<strong>5. </strong><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"><strong>ANTIBACTERIAL INGREDIENTS SLOW DOWN WHAT GROWS BACK OVERNIGHT</strong></span>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggjaYFpWFg6_text","label":"ggjaYFpWFg6_text","default":"<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">Cleaning removes what's there today. But bacteria start rebuilding within hours. FreshWipes have antibacterial ingredients that slow that regrowth down between sessions. That's the difference between buying yourself one clean day and actually interrupting the cycle.</span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggfRBomT8pi_text","label":"ggfRBomT8pi_text","default":"<strong>6. </strong><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"><strong>30 SECONDS IS EASY ENOUGH TO DO EVERY SINGLE DAY</strong></span>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggSJnR7TCHY_text","label":"ggSJnR7TCHY_text","default":"<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">Brushing sessions that take 10 minutes and end in a fight get skipped. And skipped sessions are why the buildup comes back. A routine you'll actually do every day beats a thorough one you do twice a month. FreshWipes make it easy.</span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggNu5pQjPwl_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggNu5pQjPwl_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0735/4833/3323/files/hf_20260501_073940_fce00737-3376-4bdb-885f-946bccd03a06.png"},{"type":"html","id":"ggl2nJXhNmt_text","label":"ggl2nJXhNmt_text","default":"<strong>7. </strong><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\"><strong>WHEN THE FIRST ONE GOES SMOOTHLY, EVERYTHING CHANGES</strong></span>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggVmccshQLH_text","label":"ggVmccshQLH_text","default":"<p><span style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#000000;\">Most owners say the same thing: their dog just sat there. No fight. No drama. And after that first calm session, the next one was easier. Then the next. Within a week it's just part of the routine. That's what consistent daily care actually looks like. Not a battle. Just 30 seconds.</span></p>"},{"type":"html","id":"ggAD8GJAzS3_srcSet_desktop_src","label":"ggAD8GJAzS3_srcSet_desktop_src","default":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0735/4833/3323/files/hf_20260501_070718_a1d15209-e18a-4f5e-8f17-17c64515848b.png"}],
